---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Return, Refund & Cancellation Policy | SatvaStones Jewellery"
  description="Customer return, transit replacement, and cancellation policy compliant with the Consumer Protection (E-Commerce) Rules, 2020. Dispatched from Vapi, Gujarat."
>
  <!-- Minimalist Legal Header -->
  <div class="bg-white border-b border-gray-100 py-10 sm:py-14">
    <div class="max-w-[1240px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center space-y-2">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-200 rounded-full text-xs font-bold text-emerald-800">
        <span>Consumer Protection (E-Commerce) Rules, 2020 Compliant</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 tracking-tight">Cancellations, Returns &amp; Replacements</h1>
      <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-gray-500 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
        SatvaStones Fine Anti-Tarnish Jewellery • Sole Proprietorship of <strong>Anirudh A Verma</strong> • GSTIN: 24DDAPV4074H1ZF • Chala, Vapi, Gujarat - 396191, India.
      </p>
      <p class="text-[11px] text-gray-400">
        Last Updated: November 2026 | Window: 48-Hour Transit Notice / 7-Day Replacement Guarantee
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="max-w-[1240px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-10 sm:py-16">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-8 bg-white p-6 sm:p-12 border border-gray-200 rounded-[26px] shadow-xs text-xs sm:text-sm text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">

      <!-- Executive Commitment -->
      <section class="space-y-3 bg-gray-50 p-5 rounded-2xl border border-gray-200">
        <h2 class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-900 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#f2707f]"></span>
          <span>1. Fair E-Commerce Philosophy</span>
        </h2>
        <p>
          At SatvaStones, our customer charter is built on fair trade practices and complete alignment with <strong>The Consumer Protection (E-Commerce) Rules, 2020</strong>. We ensure every patron receives genuine, pristine, hand-inspected anti-tarnish jewelry from our Vapi atelier.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Cancellation Policy & Rule Check on Unfair Penalties -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 border-b border-gray-100 pb-2">
          2. Order Cancellation Policy (Pre-Dispatch &amp; Fair Penalty Rule)
        </h2>
        <p>
          In strict compliance with <strong>Rule 6(5) of the Consumer Protection (E-Commerce) Rules, 2020</strong>, SatvaStones does not impose unfair cancellation penalties on consumers:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 pl-2">
          <li><strong>Pre-Dispatch Cancellation:</strong> You may cancel any order free of charge at any time before it is handed over to our express courier partner (typically within <strong>24 hours</strong> of placing the order). A 100% refund of the full order value will be processed immediately to your original payment method.</li>
          <li><strong>Post-Dispatch Status:</strong> Once an order has been assigned an AWB tracking number and physically handed over to BlueDart or Delhivery at our Vapi hub, transit cancellation cannot be accommodated as the parcel is in transit.</li>
          <li><strong>Mutual Fair Cancellation Clause:</strong> If SatvaStones ever has to cancel an order due to unforeseen inventory stockouts, quality rejection during pre-dispatch inspection, or courier unserviceability, we provide an immediate 100% full refund plus a <strong>compensatory ₹200 privilege voucher</strong> for your next purchase. We bear equivalent accountability.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- Transit Damage & Unboxing Video Policy -->
      <section class="space-y-4 bg-rose-50/40 p-5 sm:p-6 rounded-2xl border border-rose-200">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-[#f2707f]" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15 10.5a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z" />
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19.5 10.5c0 7.142-7.5 11.25-7.5 11.25S4.5 17.642 4.5 10.5a7.5 7.5 0 1115 0z" />
          </svg>
          <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-gray-900">
            3. 360° Unboxing Video Requirement for Transit Damage Claims
          </h2>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
          Because fine fashion jewellery items are delicate and hygienic personal adornments, all packages leave our Vapi store location in sealed, tamper-evident cartons. To protect patrons against transit mishandling and fraudulent empty-box claims:
        </p>
        <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-xl border border-rose-200 space-y-2 text-xs">
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900">Mandatory Unboxing Video Protocol:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1 text-gray-600 pl-2">
            <li>Record a continuous, unedited <strong>360-degree video</strong> beginning before opening the outer courier flyer/box.</li>
            <li>The video must clearly capture the intact shipping label, AWB number, and the opening of the sealed packaging.</li>
            <li>Show the jewellery item and any damage, broken clasp, or missing element in clear focus without cuts or pauses.</li>
            <li>Submit the video clip within <strong>48 hours of delivery</strong> to <a href="mailto:support@satvastones.in" class="text-[#a1505a] font-bold underline">support@satvastones.in</a> or upload via our customer portal.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-600">
          Upon video verification by our Vapi atelier team, a <strong>brand new replacement piece</strong> is dispatched via priority courier at <strong>zero additional cost</strong> to you.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Hygiene & Non-Returnable Items -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 border-b border-gray-100 pb-2">
          4. Hygiene Standards &amp; Non-Returnable Categories
        </h2>
        <p>
          In compliance with consumer health standards, pierced earrings, huggies, studs, and customized engraved pieces cannot be accepted for change-of-mind return once the tamper-evident hygienic seal is broken. However, all items remain <strong>100% eligible for immediate free replacement</strong> in the rare event of transit damage or material defect evidenced by unboxing footage.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Refund Timelines & Payment Mode -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 border-b border-gray-100 pb-2">
          5. Statutory Refund Timelines (5–7 Business Days)
        </h2>
        <p>
          Where a refund is authorized (e.g., pre-dispatch cancellation or stockout):
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1.5 pl-2">
          <li><strong>Prepaid Orders (Razorpay UPI / Cards / NetBanking):</strong> Refunds are initiated within <strong>24 business hours</strong> and credited back to the original source account within <strong>5 to 7 business days</strong> depending on your banking partner.</li>
          <li><strong>Cash on Delivery (COD) Orders (if applicable):</strong> Refunds are executed via direct NEFT / IMPS or UPI transfer upon receipt of customer-verified bank details.</li>
          <li><strong>Zero Hidden Deductions:</strong> No restocking fees or administrative charges are deducted for legitimate cancellations.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- Step-by-Step Claim Flow -->
      <section class="space-y-3 bg-gray-50 p-5 rounded-2xl border border-gray-200">
        <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900">
          6. Step-by-Step Replacement Initiation
        </h2>
        <ol class="list-decimal list-inside space-y-2 text-xs text-gray-700 pl-2">
          <li><strong>Step 1:</strong> Email <a href="mailto:support@satvastones.in" class="text-[#f2707f] font-bold underline">support@satvastones.in</a> within 48 hours of parcel delivery with subject line: <code>Damage Claim - [Your Order Number]</code>.</li>
          <li><strong>Step 2:</strong> Attach your continuous 360° unboxing video file (or provide a Google Drive / R2 link).</li>
          <li><strong>Step 3:</strong> Our Vapi dispatch team reviews the proof within <strong>24 hours</strong>.</li>
          <li><strong>Step 4:</strong> A replacement parcel is dispatched from our Vapi atelier with a fresh AWB tracking number sent to your email and WhatsApp.</li>
        </ol>
      </section>

    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
